# CSS Styling Rules

## File organization

- Tokens: `src/app/styles/tokens/design-tokens.css`
- Buttons: `src/app/styles/components/Button.css` (imported by `global.css`)
- Homepage cards: `src/app/styles/components/homepage.css`
- CTAs: `src/app/styles/components/cta.css`
- Accordion/FAQ: `src/app/styles/components/accordion.css`

## Forbidden in new CSS

- `linear-gradient` / `radial-gradient` for colors, fades, or glows
- `backdrop-filter` / glass morphism on cards
- 3D button depth: `box-shadow: 0 Npx 0`, `translateY` on `:active`
- Deprecated classes: `.problem-card`, `.service-tile`, `.home-cta-premium`, `.home-faq-item`, `.about-panel::before`
- Card `::before` / `::after` top or bottom accent bars (green/crimson strips)

## Solid replacements

```css
/* chips */
background: var(--color-primary-50);

/* cards — uniform border only; no ::before/::after accent bars */
border: 1px solid var(--color-slate-200);

/* section surfaces */
background: white; /* or var(--color-slate-50) */
```

## Elevation

Use semantic tokens: `var(--elevation-1)`, `var(--elevation-2)`, `var(--elevation-3)` — not custom multi-layer gradient shadows.

## Transitions

Use design-token transitions: `var(--transition-standard)`, `var(--transition-complex)`. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
